{"451340":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Gold Mining Simulator","steam_appid":451340,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4056800,3228240,773500,715070,2900730],"detailed_description":"Make your gold mining dream come true - start with a few spare bucks and work your way up to becoming a millionaire! The Gold Mining Simulator game is based on real-world mining techniques and machines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/668ddb7079720d2f412c812476a963b2.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/668ddb7079720d2f412c812476a963b2.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Sit behind the wheel of multiple vehicles such as excavator, drill, front-end loader, bulldozer, and others. The whole gold mining operation depends on your steering skills!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/4c39016c87cf8cc6c9963c7291e770b3.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/4c39016c87cf8cc6c9963c7291e770b3.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Experience the challenging life of a chief mechanic. Various parts of machines can break when least expected and cost you big time.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/e8c93aba1917fe6c6f7c753b8c9a881f.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/e8c93aba1917fe6c6f7c753b8c9a881f.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Keep improving your gold mining business. Start with a simple bucket and a hog pan, lease your first claim, and upgrade it to next tiers, as you begin to dig gold.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/3b69ee42c8a75e4e04f7c6203d80c6d1.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/3b69ee42c8a75e4e04f7c6203d80c6d1.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Admire highly detailed vehicles and gold mining machines. Purchase new and more efficient wash plant parts to increase your earnings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/a1f136c2aaf4cf3424463990ad4a9676.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/a1f136c2aaf4cf3424463990ad4a9676.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>We created a big, detailed world with four unique gold mining claims. On each, you will find a fully deformable terrain. Each fragment of our world has its own background story you can discover in your spare time.","about_the_game":"Make your gold mining dream come true - start with a few spare bucks and work your way up to becoming a millionaire! The Gold Mining Simulator game is based on real-world mining techniques and machines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/668ddb7079720d2f412c812476a963b2.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/668ddb7079720d2f412c812476a963b2.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Sit behind the wheel of multiple vehicles such as excavator, drill, front-end loader, bulldozer, and others. The whole gold mining operation depends on your steering skills!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/4c39016c87cf8cc6c9963c7291e770b3.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/4c39016c87cf8cc6c9963c7291e770b3.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Experience the challenging life of a chief mechanic. Various parts of machines can break when least expected and cost you big time.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/e8c93aba1917fe6c6f7c753b8c9a881f.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/e8c93aba1917fe6c6f7c753b8c9a881f.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Keep improving your gold mining business. Start with a simple bucket and a hog pan, lease your first claim, and upgrade it to next tiers, as you begin to dig gold.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/3b69ee42c8a75e4e04f7c6203d80c6d1.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/3b69ee42c8a75e4e04f7c6203d80c6d1.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>Admire highly detailed vehicles and gold mining machines. Purchase new and more efficient wash plant parts to increase your earnings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/a1f136c2aaf4cf3424463990ad4a9676.webp?t=1785148411\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/extras\/a1f136c2aaf4cf3424463990ad4a9676.poster.avif?t=1785148411\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 \/><\/picture><\/span><br>We created a big, detailed world with four unique gold mining claims. On each, you will find a fully deformable terrain. Each fragment of our world has its own background story you can discover in your spare time.","short_description":"Become a gold miner. Work hard, dig deep, explore the world, and you’ll become the wealthiest person in Alaska. Use a variety of specialist machines to find as much gold as you can.","supported_languages":"영어, 프랑스어, 이탈리아어, 독일어, 스페인어 - 스페인, 폴란드어, 포르투갈어 - 포르투갈, 러시아어, 일본어, 중국어 간체, 노르웨이어, 튀르키예어, 네덜란드어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/24ff2bf93d28a2268fdd1644bae0a17502bde011\/header.jpg?t=1785148411","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/fea3cd5b8bcea0709481c67297a1d6a7ce053e1a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785148411","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/451340\/fea3cd5b8bcea0709481c67297a1d6a7ce053e1a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785148411","website":"https:\/\/goldminingsimulator.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows 7 (64-bit) or Newer. Doesn't support Mac OS.<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 760<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 11<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 19 GB 사용 가능 공간<br><\/li><li><strong>사운드카드:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/